# Generated semantic index — regenerated locally via `pypeeker index src/`
# and in CI as part of the Docker image build. `.semantic-tool/` is the
# pre-rename directory name, still read (and ignored) for local back-compat.
# The check baseline is the one committed artifact under .pypeeker/: it is the
# ratchet-of-record for the full-suite self-lint (`check --baseline`), so it
# must travel with the repo and be re-included here.
.pypeeker/*
!.pypeeker/check-baseline.json
.semantic-tool/

# Claude Code workflow worktrees (transient)
.claude/worktrees/
